OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after death of man
OL,4,Ain Broadstairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a man in Broadstairs.
OL,10,FKent Police said it was called to a
OL,11,Freport of concern for a person in the
OL,12,FRanelagh Grove area of St Peter's just
OL,13,Fafter 07:40 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FOfficers arrived along with paramedics
OL,16,Fand a man in his 30s was confirmed
OL,17,Fdead.
OL,19,FHis next of kin has been informed.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
